		<entry>
		<author><name><![CDATA[F1RMB]]></name></author>
		<updated>2025-02-15T08:54:31</updated>

		<published>2025-02-15T08:54:31</published>
		<id>http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=4878&amp;p=35752#p35752</id>
		<link href="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=4878&amp;p=35752#p35752"/>
		<title type="html"><![CDATA[New MD-UV380/RT-3S/DM-1701/RT-84 Beta version 2025 02 15.]]></title>

		
		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=4878&amp;p=35752#p35752"><![CDATA[
<ul><li> Use double height font in uiCPS and Hotspot screens, if enabled.</li><li> Adds zero VOX tail value (1ms in fact), needed for some packet radio setups.</li><li> Add APRS Tx Power setting (defaulted to Master).  <ul>  <li> see "<strong class="text-strong">Ch Power</strong>" in "<em class="text-italics">APRS options</em>"</li>  </ul></li><li> Fix a GPS problem when entering/leaving the Hotspot mode.</li><li> As usual, some cleanups.</li></ul>The firmwares are available at: <a href="https://drive.proton.me/urls/G1GE21DWAC#d3hug6WaFofI" class="postlink">https://drive.proton.me/urls/G1GE21DWAC#d3hug6WaFofI</a><br>The voice prompts are available at: <a href="https://drive.proton.me/urls/H0XNJZFH08#YPSZxRlhHBGG" class="postlink">https://drive.proton.me/urls/H0XNJZFH08#YPSZxRlhHBGG</a><br><br><strong class="text-strong">NOTE</strong>: You <span style="text-decoration:underline">need</span> to use a CPS version greater or equal the the 2025/01/26. See the CPS section <a href="https://www.opengd77.com/viewforum.php?f=12" class="postlink">viewforum.php?f=12</a><br><br>For translators, the on-screen texts, voice prompts CSV and CPS XML files are located at: <a href="https://drive.proton.me/urls/256SP2W1NM#mC9d2L32MEmb" class="postlink">https://drive.proton.me/urls/256SP2W1NM#mC9d2L32MEmb</a><br>The voice-prompts and localization files have not changed since the last beta.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=56">F1RMB</a> — Sat Feb 15, 2025 8:54 am</p><hr />
]]></content>
